{{ 'scent-storefront.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- liquid
  assign rotation_collection = collections.fragrances
  comment
    Do not trust variant ORDER. Products carry a 5ml vial AND a full bottle (the PRD records Creed
    Aventus with a 5ml at $20 alongside a 3.3 fl oz at $408), so "variants | first" can hand back
    the bottle - the hero would print "$408 per vial" and rotation_plan would go nil at the same
    time, wiping BOTH subscription prices off the subscription page. Scan for the plan-bearing $20
    vial instead, the way main-product.liquid, studio-fragrance-card.liquid, vial-studio.liquid and
    full-bottles.liquid all do, and skip the internal add-on helper and $0 products that nine other
    surfaces already exclude - either could otherwise become the product the hero reads, and so
    source every price on the page.
  endcomment
  assign rotation_variant = blank
  assign rotation_plan = blank
  for candidate in rotation_collection.products
    if candidate.handle == 'extra-5ml-vial-add-on' or candidate.price == 0
      continue
    endif
    for candidate_variant in candidate.variants
      assign candidate_title = candidate_variant.title | downcase | remove: ' '
      if candidate_title contains '5ml' and candidate_variant.price == 2000
        assign candidate_plan = candidate_variant.selling_plan_allocations | first
        if candidate_plan
          assign rotation_variant = candidate_variant
          assign rotation_plan = candidate_plan
          break
        endif
      endif
    endfor
    if rotation_plan != blank
      break
    endif
  endfor
  assign rotation_renewal = rotation_plan.price_adjustments.last.price | default: rotation_variant.price
  assign rotation_url = rotation_collection.url | default: '/collections/fragrances'
  if rotation_plan
    assign our_price_label = rotation_renewal | money_without_trailing_zeros | append: '/month'
  else
    assign our_price_label = section.settings.fallback_our_price
  endif
-%}
<section class="scent-route rotation" aria-labelledby="MonthlyRotationTitle">

  {%- comment -%}
    HERO. 2026-09-26 conversion pass. Replaces the 2026-09-13 "Your Monthly Rotation /
    Optional subscription" mock. That version led with optionality and explained the queue
    before the offer. This version states the product, then the live plan price, then a
    one-time escape hatch. Every plan price still comes from rotation_plan / rotation_renewal.
    The "$15" / "$20" in older comments remain illustrative only.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <header class="scent-route__intro rotation__hero">
    <p class="scent-eyebrow">Monthly Rotation</p>
    <h1 id="MonthlyRotationTitle">One 5ml a month. You pick the scent.</h1>
    <p class="rotation__lede">Authentic designer and niche, decanted from the original bottle. Queue up to five months of fragrances. Skip or cancel anytime.</p>
    {%- if rotation_plan -%}
      <p class="rotation__price">{{ rotation_plan.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} first shipment, then {{ rotation_renewal | money_without_trailing_zeros }}/month. Shipping included. No fees to skip or cancel.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <a class="scent-button" href="#RotationScents">Choose your first scent <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span></a>
    {%- comment -%}
      One-time alt line. Plan money stays object-derived. One-time shipping is NOT on the
      selling plan, so it is a theme setting (default $4.99) rather than a typed money filter
      that could drift from checkout. Hide the ship clause if the setting is emptied.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="rotation__alt">
      Prefer not to subscribe?
      <a href="{{ rotation_url }}">Shop one-time vials</a>
      {%- if rotation_variant -%}
        &mdash; {{ rotation_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} first{% if all_products['extra-5ml-vial-add-on'].variants.first.available %}, {{ all_products['extra-5ml-vial-add-on'].variants.first.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} each extra{% endif %}.
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.one_time_shipping_note != blank -%}
        {{ section.settings.one_time_shipping_note }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="rotation__inner">

    {%- comment -%}
      HOW ROTATION WORKS. This 01/02/03 spine is deliberately NOT the homepage's
      (01 Pick / 02 We fill it / 03 Wear it, sections/scent-studio-home.liquid). The homepage
      steps describe a one-time vial; these describe Rotation. Both are correct; do not merge them.
      2026-09-26: step 03 shortened. Queue / blank-month / FOTM detail still lives in the account
      after purchase; putting all three in the hero and again here was repeating the stall.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="rotation__block" aria-labelledby="RotationStepsTitle">
      <h2 class="rotation__h2" id="RotationStepsTitle">How Rotation works</h2>
      <ol class="rotation__steps" role="list">
        <li class="rotation__step">
          <p class="rotation__step-num">01 Start</p>
          <p class="rotation__step-copy">Choose your first scent from the catalog. That&rsquo;s month one.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="rotation__step">
          <p class="rotation__step-num">02 We ship</p>
          <p class="rotation__step-copy">A 5ml atomizer every month. About 60 sprays. Authentic fragrance, from the original bottle. Shipping included.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="rotation__step">
          <p class="rotation__step-num">03 Then plan</p>
          <p class="rotation__step-copy">After month one, queue up to five months ahead, skip a month, or cancel in your account. No calls, no fees.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%}
      TWO OPTIONS. Jeff's mock says "$18 each extra in that order", and that claim IS backed.
      Established on live 2026-09-13: normalizeCart() in assets/basenote-commerce.js replaces the
      extra eligible unit with the extra-5ml-vial-add-on helper (priced 1800). The figure is read
      from an object here, never typed as a literal. 2026-09-26: Rotation card says shipping
      included so this block does not contradict the hero. One-time card does not promise free shipping.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      PRICE COMPARE. 2026-09-26, revised same day: full retail bottles, not other decanters.
      Sits AFTER the scent grid so it does not delay Choose this scent.
      Bottle figures are merchant-edited house / authorized-retailer list prices for the size
      named in the row (Jeff, 2026-09-26: Alexandria II $630 / 3.3 oz; Aventus $510 / 3.3 oz;
      Orom $500 / 4.2 oz; Bond Nomad $470 / 3.3 oz).
      Re-check when a house changes list. Our column uses the live renewal (our_price_label).
      Strikethrough on the bottle column is ON — this is "don't buy the bottle first,"
      not a fake markdown of someone else's 5ml. No checkmarks. No "Why Pay More?".
      Hide the block by clearing compare_title or all four product rows.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign compare_has_row = false -%}
    {%- if section.settings.row_1_product != blank or section.settings.row_2_product != blank or section.settings.row_3_product != blank or section.settings.row_4_product != blank -%}
      {%- assign compare_has_row = true -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.compare_title != blank and compare_has_row -%}
      <section class="rotation__block rotation-compare" aria-labelledby="RotationCompareTitle">
        <h2 class="rotation__h2" id="RotationCompareTitle">{{ section.settings.compare_title }}</h2>
        {%- if section.settings.compare_subtitle != blank -%}
          <p class="rotation-compare__lede">{{ section.settings.compare_subtitle }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="rotation-compare__table-wrap">
          <table class="rotation-compare__table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">{{ section.settings.column_1_header }}</th>
                <th scope="col">{{ section.settings.column_2_header }}</th>
                <th scope="col" class="rotation-compare__ours-head">{{ section.settings.column_3_header }}</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for i in (1..4) %}
                {% liquid
                  assign product_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_product'
                  assign competitor_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_competitor'
                  assign product_name = section.settings[product_key]
                  assign competitor_price = section.settings[competitor_key]
                %}
                {% if product_name != blank %}
                  <tr>
                    <th scope="row">{{ product_name }}</th>
                    <td class="rotation-compare__them">{{ competitor_price }}</td>
                    <td class="rotation-compare__ours"><span>{{ our_price_label }}</span></td>
                  </tr>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        {%- if section.settings.compare_footnote != blank -%}
          <p class="rotation-compare__note">{{ section.settings.compare_footnote }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </section>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      START WITH A SCENT. Unchanged data model: the same collection loop, filtered on
      "allocation and variant.available", so only products that really carry the plan appear.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="rotation__block" aria-labelledby="RotationScentsTitle">
      <div class="rotation__grid-head">
        <h2 class="rotation__h2" id="RotationScentsTitle">Start with a scent</h2>
        {%- if rotation_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
          <a class="rotation__see-all" href="{{ rotation_url }}">See all {{ rotation_collection.products_count }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div id="RotationScents" class="scent-grid">
        {%- for product in rotation_collection.products limit: 12 -%}
          {%- if product.handle == 'extra-5ml-vial-add-on' or product.price == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign variant = blank -%}
          {%- assign allocation = blank -%}
          {%- for product_variant in product.variants -%}
            {%- assign product_variant_title = product_variant.title | downcase | remove: ' ' -%}
            {%- if product_variant_title contains '5ml' and product_variant.price == 2000 -%}
              {%- assign product_allocation = product_variant.selling_plan_allocations | first -%}
              {%- if product_allocation -%}
                {%- assign variant = product_variant -%}
                {%- assign allocation = product_allocation -%}
                {%- break -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- assign card_renewal = allocation.price_adjustments.last.price | default: variant.price -%}
          {%- if allocation and variant.available -%}
            <article class="scent-card">
              <a class="scent-card__media" href="{{ product.url }}?purchase=subscription#monthly-rotation" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- if product.featured_image -%}
                  <img
                    src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    srcset="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 }} 1x, {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }} 2x"
                    alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                    width="300"
                    height="{{ 300 | divided_by: product.featured_image.aspect_ratio | round }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="scent-card__img">
                {%- else -%}
                  <span class="scent-card__vial">{% render 'vial-illustration', product: product %}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </a>
              <p class="scent-card__brand">{{ product.vendor }}</p>
              <h3 class="rotation__card-title">
                <a href="{{ product.url }}?purchase=subscription#monthly-rotation">{{ product.title | remove_first: product.vendor | strip }}</a>
              </h3>
              <p class="scent-card__format">{{ allocation.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} first shipment, then {{ card_renewal | money_without_trailing_zeros }}/month</p>
              <a class="scent-button rotation__card-cta" href="{{ product.url }}?purchase=subscription#monthly-rotation">Choose this scent <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
            </article>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%}
      CLOSING DISCLOSURE. ROSCA-relevant. "until you cancel" and "renewal date" are load-bearing.
      Treat this paragraph as frozen legal copy. 2026-09-26 hero/options/compare edits must not weaken it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="rotation__block rotation__disclosure" aria-labelledby="RotationTermsTitle">
      <h2 class="rotation__disclosure-title" id="RotationTermsTitle">Subscription terms</h2>
      <p>Monthly Rotation is an automatically renewing subscription. By starting it you authorize recurring charges until you cancel. Checkout shows the plan, price, and renewal date. Prefer not to subscribe? <a href="{{ rotation_url }}">Shop one-time vials</a> - no subscription is required. <a href="/pages/faq">Read subscription FAQs</a>.</p>
    </section>

  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.rotation__inner { max-width: 1120px; margin-inline: auto; }
.rotation .rotation__hero { max-width: 44rem; }
.scent-route.rotation .rotation__lede { max-width: 38rem; margin-inline: auto; color: var(--scent-muted); }
.scent-route.rotation .rotation__price { max-width: 38rem; margin: 1.25rem auto 0; font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--scent-muted); }
.scent-route.rotation .rotation__alt { max-width: 38rem; margin: 1rem auto 0; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--scent-muted); }
.scent-route.rotation .rotation__alt a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
.rotation__block { margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.75rem); }
.rotation__h2 { margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font: 500 clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.6rem)/1.14 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; }

.rotation__steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 14rem), 1fr)); gap: 1.75rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.rotation__step { min-width: 0; padding-top: 1.1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
.rotation__step-num { margin: 0 0 .7rem; font: 500 .7rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--scent-green); }
.rotation__step-copy { margin: 0; font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--scent-muted); }

.rotation__options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 17rem), 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
.rotation__option { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; padding: 1.6rem 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--scent-line); background: #ebe6d9; }
.rotation__option--featured { border-color: var(--scent-green); border-width: 2px; }
.rotation__option-title { margin: 0 0 .8rem; font: 500 1.5rem/1.2 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; }
.rotation__option-price { margin: 0 0 .55rem; font: 500 .9rem/1.6 'Jost', sans-serif; }
.rotation__option-copy { margin: 0; font-size: .86rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--scent-muted); }
.rotation__option-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; align-self: flex-start; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--scent-gold); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 500; }

.rotation__grid-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.rotation__grid-head .rotation__h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }
.rotation__see-all { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; min-height: 44px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--scent-gold); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 500; }
.rotation .scent-grid { margin-top: 2rem; }

.rotation .scent-card__media {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
  padding: 8%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #faf7f0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.rotation .scent-card__img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: contain;
  object-position: center center;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  transition: transform 0.6s;
}
.rotation .scent-card__media::before { content: "5ml"; position: absolute; top: 0.7rem; left: 0.7rem; z-index: 1; padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem; background: #1e2e24; color: #f3eee3; font: 600 0.62rem/1 'Jost', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.rotation .scent-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.rotation .scent-card__brand,
.rotation .rotation__card-title,
.rotation .scent-card__format { flex-shrink: 0; }
.rotation .rotation__card-cta { margin-top: auto; }
.rotation__card-title {margin: 0;font: 500 1rem/1.3 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;min-height: 0;letter-spacing: -0.02em;white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;}
.rotation__card-title a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.rotation .rotation__card-cta { width: 100%; gap: 1rem; min-height: 44px; padding: .7rem 1rem; font-size: .72rem; }

/* Compare table. Same hairline language as How Rotation works. Highlight column uses
   the option-card fill (#ebe6d9), not a sales-green. */
.rotation-compare .rotation__h2 { text-align: center; }
.rotation-compare__lede {
  max-width: 36rem;
  margin: -0.75rem auto 1.75rem;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: .88rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--scent-muted);
}
.rotation-compare__table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; border-top: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
.rotation-compare__table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: transparent; }
.rotation-compare__table th,
.rotation-compare__table td {
  padding: 1.05rem 1rem;
  text-align: left;
  vertical-align: middle;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--scent-line);
}
.rotation-compare__table thead th {
  font: 500 .7rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: .14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--scent-green);
}
.rotation-compare__table tbody th {
  font: 500 1.05rem/1.3 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
  color: var(--scent-ink, var(--scent-green));
  font-weight: 500;
}
.rotation-compare__them { font: 400 .9rem/1.5 'Jost', sans-serif; color: var(--scent-muted); text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
.rotation-compare__ours-head,
.rotation-compare__ours { background: #ebe6d9; }
.rotation-compare__ours { font: 500 .9rem/1.5 'Jost', sans-serif; color: var(--scent-green); white-space: nowrap; }
.rotation-compare__note {
  max-width: 40rem;
  margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
  font-size: .78rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--scent-muted);
  text-align: center;
}

.rotation .rotation__disclosure { max-width: 44rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--scent-line); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--scent-ink); }
.rotation .rotation__disclosure-title { margin: 0 0 .6rem; font: 500 1rem/1.3 'Jost', sans-serif; letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--scent-ink); }
.rotation .rotation__disclosure a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }

@media (max-width: 749px) {
  .scent-route.rotation .rotation__hero { text-align: left; }
  .scent-route.rotation .rotation__lede,
  .scent-route.rotation .rotation__price,
  .scent-route.rotation .rotation__alt { margin-inline: 0; }
  .rotation .rotation__card-title { font-size: 1.3rem; min-height: 3.1rem; }
  .rotation .rotation__option { padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem; }

  .rotation-compare__table thead { display: none; }
  .rotation-compare__table,
  .rotation-compare__table tbody,
  .rotation-compare__table tr,
  .rotation-compare__table th,
  .rotation-compare__table td { display: block; width: 100%; }
  .rotation-compare__table tr { padding: 1rem 0 1.15rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
  .rotation-compare__table tbody th { padding: 0 0 .35rem; border: 0; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .rotation-compare__them,
  .rotation-compare__ours { padding: .2rem 0; border: 0; background: transparent; }
  .rotation-compare__them::before {
    content: "Full bottle  ";
    display: block;
    font: 500 .65rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--scent-green);
  }
  .rotation-compare__ours::before {
    content: "Monthly Rotation  ";
    display: block;
    font: 500 .65rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Monthly Rotation",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "one_time_shipping_note",
      "label": "One-time shipping note",
      "default": "Shipping $4.99, free at 3 vials.",
      "info": "Not derived from the selling plan. Clear this field to hide the clause."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Price compare"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "compare_title",
      "label": "Compare title",
      "default": "One scent is a habit. A wardrobe is a choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "compare_subtitle",
      "label": "Compare subtitle",
      "default": "Full bottles lock you in. A 5ml Rotation vial lets you wear Alexandria II this month and Aventus next. Same juice. Shipping included"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "column_1_header",
      "label": "Column 1",
      "default": "Fragrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "column_2_header",
      "label": "Column 2",
      "default": "Full Bottle Retail Price"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "column_3_header",
      "label": "Column 3",
      "default": "Monthly Rotation (5ml)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "fallback_our_price",
      "label": "Fallback our price",
      "default": "$20/month",
      "info": "Used only if the live selling plan cannot be read."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "compare_footnote",
      "label": "Compare footnote",
      "default": "Bottle prices are current house or authorized-retailer list for the size named, checked September 2026, and can move. Rotation is the first-month plan price, then the renewal shown, until you cancel. A 5ml vial is not a full bottle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_1_product",
      "label": "Row 1 product",
      "default": "Xerjoff Alexandria II"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_1_competitor",
      "label": "Row 1 full bottle",
      "default": "$630 / 3.3 oz"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_2_product",
      "label": "Row 2 product",
      "default": "Creed Aventus"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_2_competitor",
      "label": "Row 2 full bottle",
      "default": "$510 / 3.3 oz"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_3_product",
      "label": "Row 3 product",
      "default": "Bvlgari Le Gemme Orom"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_3_competitor",
      "label": "Row 3 full bottle",
      "default": "$500 / 4.2 oz"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_4_product",
      "label": "Row 4 product",
      "default": "Bond No. 9 Nomad"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_4_competitor",
      "label": "Row 4 full bottle",
      "default": "$470 / 3.3 oz"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}